OL,3,GNEWSAStabbed boy felt train attacker
OL,4,A'was not sane'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 14-year-old boy stabbed by a man who
OL,7,Fwent on to attack people on a train
OL,8,Fsaid he did not feel the knifeman was
OL,9,F"mentally sane", a court heard.
OL,11,FThe teenager was attacked in
OL,12,FPeterborough the day before Anthony
OL,13,FWilliams is accused of trying to kill
OL,14,F10 people on a London-bound train that
OL,15,Fhad to make an emergency stop in
OL,16,FHuntingdon in November 2025.
OL,18,FIn a video recorded interview played to
OL,19,Fjurors at Cambridge Crown Court, the
OL,20,Fboy said: "This random guy, I'd
OL,21,Fliterally never seen in my life, he
OL,22,Fjust pulls out a knife and stabs me."
